  "motion": {
    "_source": "Durations and the standard/emphasized/linear easings are Google's, from material-web tokens/versions/v0_192/_md-sys-motion.scss. `spring` is Google's M3E motion scheme (androidx material3 tokens v0_14_0: spring damping ratios and stiffnesses); `easing`/`duration` inside each spring are the `linear()` sample of that spring and its settle time, derived here because CSS has no spring primitive, and `fallback` is our cubic-bezier approximation for engines without `linear()`. `expressive-over`/`expressive-out` and the `stagger` step are ours.",
